<h1>Account temporarily locked</h1>
<p>Hi <%= @user.first_name %>, we detected several failed login attempts and locked your account until <%= l(@locked_until, format: :long) %>.</p>
<% if @unlock_url %>
<p>If it was you, unlock the account and sign in with this link, valid while the lock lasts: <%= @unlock_url %></p>
<% end %>
<p style="color:#666;font-size:13px">If this was not you, we recommend resetting your password (it also unlocks the account): <%= @forgot_url %></p>
